          },
          "confidence": 0.86,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-28f8e5bd30a48825",
          "evidence_type": "scientific_or_technical_explanation",
          "paraphrase": "The heterochromatic eyes reveal the creatures are the degenerated descendants of the Martense family.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev06",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "One eye was blue, the other brown. They were the dissimilar Martense eyes of the old legends, and I knew in one inundating cataclysm of voiceless horror what had become of that vanished family; the terrible and thunder-crazed house of Martense."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 47795,
            "paragraph_ids": [
              "p00074"
            ],
            "start_char": 47548
          },
          "confidence": 0.85,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-3c70ba0f50c57dc4",
          "evidence_type": "scientific_or_technical_explanation",
          "paraphrase": "The creatures are explained as the product of biological degeneration from isolated inbreeding and cannibalism.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev05",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "It was the ultimate product of mammalian degeneration; the frightful outcome of isolated spawning, multiplication, and cannibal nutrition above and below the ground; the embodiment of all the snarling chaos and grinning fear that lurk behind life."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 44547,
            "paragraph_ids": [
              "p00069"
            ],
            "start_char": 44361
          },
          "confidence": 0.7,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-48d624fe0dec5973",
          "evidence_type": "catastrophe",
          "paraphrase": "A swarm of thousands of creatures pours out of the ground to spread death across the region.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "decoded literal Unicode escape in quote",
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev17",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "a burst of multitudinous and leprous life\\u2014a loathsome night-spawned flood of organic corruption more devastatingly hideous than the blackest conjurations of mortal madness and morbidity."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 44170,
            "paragraph_ids": [
              "p00069"
            ],
            "start_char": 44098
          },
          "confidence": 0.8,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-594eb3999f4a9643",
          "evidence_type": "character_reaction",
          "paraphrase": "The narrator describes lasting trauma requiring opiates during thunderstorms.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev12",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "I can not sleep at night now, and have to take opiates when it thunders."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 28198,
            "paragraph_ids": [
              "p00046"
            ],
            "start_char": 27912
          },
          "confidence": 0.8,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-6610896efdafd130",
          "evidence_type": "extrapolative_consequence",
          "paraphrase": "Generations of isolation and intermarriage lead the family to degenerate and diverge into the squatter population.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev08",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "Their social contacts grew fewer and fewer, till at last they took to intermarrying with the numerous menial class about the estate. Many of the crowded family degenerated, moved across the valley, and merged with the mongrel population which was later to produce the pitiful squatters."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 27911,
            "paragraph_ids": [
              "p00046"
            ],
            "start_char": 27789
          },
          "confidence": 0.75,
          "entity_ids": [],
          "event_ids": [],
          "evidence_id": "sfev-76635c93e5da982a",
          "evidence_type": "extrapolative_consequence",
          "paraphrase": "The Martense family carries an inherited trait of mismatched eye colors across generations.",
          "provenance": [
            {
              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [
                "used bounded whitespace/typography/case fallback"
              ],
              "raw_id": "ev07",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "In appearance all were marked by a peculiar inherited dissimilarity of eyes; one generally being blue and the other brown."
        },
        {
          "anchor": {
            "end_char": 1183,
            "paragraph_ids": [
